{"file_name": "Screenshot_4.png", "id": "1908888479739094", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823802_1908888483072427_1149639399900384217_n.png?_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=FhxZcVpXImwQ7kNvwFErhKR&_nc_oc=AdpxKX9LCujwkzbm6fct3Qvonz5t5CiRBr4yUMDc8bIIdq1zbSfXlCDKLr4QYqQQh8M&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQTBengCyjJtFR2LLOrUkl8Hr4oMDFFwA418274dIS-1YQ&oe=6B0B2604"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Ultimate Car Parking & Driving Simulator", "keywords": ["CarSimulator", "CarParkingSimulator", "DrivingSimulator", "UltimateCarParking", "CarRacingGame"], "long_description": "Ultimate Car Parking & Driving Simulator puts you behind the wheel in the most realistic 3D driving experience! Master the art of parking, navigate challenging traffic, and test your driving skills in multiple environments. Whether you\u2019re a beginner learning to park or a pro racing through city streets, this simulator has it all.\n\ud83d\ude97 Realistic Car Physics \u2013 Experience lifelike car handling for an authentic driving feel.\n\ud83c\udfd9\ufe0f Diverse Environments \u2013 Park in cities, busy streets, tight lots, and more.\n\ud83c\udfaf Challenging Missions \u2013 Complete parking challenges, driving tests, and time trials.\n\ud83c\udf1f VR & 3D Mode \u2013 Immerse yourself in a virtual driving world for ultimate realism.\n\ud83d\udea6 Learn & Improve \u2013 Perfect for beginners learning parking and for pros refining skills.\nStep into the world of Ultimate Car Parking & Driving Simulator and master parking, driving, and racing in an incredible 3D experience!", "short_description": "Master realistic car parking, driving, and racing in immersive 3D worlds!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/vcode-studio-privacy-policy/home", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "VCode St